# This repo lives in a OneDrive-synced folder, so Windows and the sync client
# will eventually drop their own files into it. Keep them out of a public repo.
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# OneDrive / Office lock and conflict files
~$*
*conflicted copy*

# macOS and Linux
.DS_Store
._*
.Trash-*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Wrangler local state. `wrangler dev` writes a cf.json here containing the
# IP-geolocation of whoever ran it — city, region, lat/long, ASN — plus
# miniflare cache databases. None of it belongs in a public repo.
.wrangler/

# Scratch work that should never reach the published site
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
/tmp/

# Full-resolution logo originals (~1.6 MB, unreferenced by the site). The
# trimmed, resized, quantised derivatives the pages actually load are checked
# in under assets/logos/. Keep the originals locally — the derivation recipe
# is in the README Notes so they can be rebuilt from a fresh copy of the marks.
/logos/

# Maintainer documentation — kept local, not published and not in the repo.
# NOTE: this is the deployment runbook and the survey/ethics spec. Anyone who
# clones this repo gets no deploy instructions, so the things a deployer must
# not get wrong are duplicated where they cannot be missed: the CSP
# report-only -> enforce rollout is commented in `_headers`, and the font
# regeneration recipe is commented in `assets/tokens.css`. Keep it that way.
/docs/

# AI coding-assistant instructions and local agent state
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
QWEN.md
